Title: Lags

/* The mechanics of the committed story's first scenes (a default fade, a CUT, two AUTO-ANIMATEs; focus, show and
   sound effects) with short narration, so that the capture stays small. */

# One

INT. TITLE CARD - DAY #sc1#

Same name, new place {id=title cell=mc class=title}
A small idea {id=sub cell=bc class=muted}

NARRATOR
Here is a title.

INT. FIRST SCREEN - DAY #sc2#

First screen {id=tag cell=tl class=label}
A box {id=box cell=ml class=box}
Another box {id=twin cell=mr class=box visible=false}

[[effects
  f1: focus box at word("box").end
  r1: show twin at word("another").end
]]

NARRATOR
Picture a box. Then another. Done.

# Two

> CUT

INT. THE NAMES - DAY #sc3#

Box one {id=one cell=ml class=box}
Box two {id=two cell=mr class=box}
Every box has a name {id=tag cell=tc class=label}

[[effects
  f1: focus tag at word("name").end
]]

NARRATOR
Give every box a name. Fine.

> AUTO-ANIMATE

INT. THE NEXT SCREEN - DAY #sc4#

Box one {id=one cell=mc class=box}
Every box has a name {id=tag cell=tc class=accent}
Same name, so it moves {id=hint cell=bc class=muted}

[[effects
  s1: sound whoosh at transition.start
]]

NARRATOR
Box one moves. There.

> AUTO-ANIMATE

INT. A NEW NAME - DAY #sc5#

Box one {id=one cell=mr class=box}
Same name, so it moves {id=hint cell=bc class=accent}
Box three {id=three cell=ml class=box}

[[effects
  s1: sound ding at transition.start
]]

NARRATOR
A new box appears.
